{
    "title": "StockX - Sneakers and Apparel",
    "description": "Buy and sell on the ultimate marketplace for the world\u2019s most sought after sneakers, apparel, collectibles, and more with StockX. Stock up on the latest kicks and trends with exclusive brands and products. Buy the latest and greatest from the hottest clothing and sneaker collections to trendy handbags and the latest electronics \u2013 it\u2019s all on StockX.\r\n\r\nShop clothing and footwear from Nike, Air Jordan, adidas, Ugg, Vans, Asics, New Balance, and more with the latest releases just a tap away. Buy apparel, shoes, and accessories confidently with StockX\u2019s verification process. Our team of verification experts inspect and verify every product sold on our app so you can shop worry-free.\r\n\r\nStockX is an elevated sneakers and clothing app marketplace putting you in control of the value of almost every item on our marketplace. Looking to buy? Simply place a bid with your offer and set the price you want to pay. Looking to sell? Sellers can also set asks on the products they list with sales information available on every product page. With Live Market Pricing, anyone can view real time StockX market data to find the best deals or set the best price.\r\n\r\nBuying and selling products for the world\u2019s top brands has never been easier with StockX \u2013 from top sneakers to designer clothing and everyday essentials. Discover the best of footwear, clothing, and collectibles apps on the digital marketplace trusted by millions and featured in: ESPN, The New York Times, WSJ, Forbes, TechCrunch, Yahoo Finance, CNN, GQ, BBC, The Daily Show, Hypebeast, Bleacher Report...and many more.\r\n\r\nDownload StockX today to buy and sell exclusive sneakers, apparel, accessories, and much more.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS:\r\nStockX is a resale marketplace that functions like a stock market, where Buyers place Bids and Sellers place Asks. When a Bid and Ask meet on a price, the order goes through automatically and instantaneously.\r\n\r\nStockX Features\r\n\r\nBUY & SELL - MADE SAFE & EASY\r\n- Sell your brand-name items and set your own asks \r\n- Sellers send every item sold to StockX for verification\r\n- Our global experts inspect products, ensuring each item is genuine\r\n- Buy the hottest items in sneakers, apparel and more\r\n- Buyers can shop confidently and sellers never need to worry about chargebacks\r\n\r\nDISCOVER YOUR FAVORITES\r\n- Find clothes, sneakers, electronics, and accessories all in the palm of your hand\r\n- Explore a variety of brands to shop from \u2013 Supreme, BAPE, Fear of God, and more\r\n- Find deadstock condition sneakers including Yeezy, Jordans, Nike, adidas and New Balance\r\n- From Funko Pop collectibles to luxury products and brands like Louis Vuitton, Gucci, land more \u2013 StockX has it all\r\n\r\nLIVE MARKET PRICING\r\n- Find the best deals with real time StockX data\r\n- The stock market for sneakers and clothing \u2013 Compare asks when looking for your favorite products and set your own bid\r\n- Get sales information on every product and learn about what you\u2019re buying\r\n\r\nPAY WHAT YOU WANT\r\n- Determine the value of almost every item on our marketplace\r\n- Make an offer and set the price for what you want to pay\r\n\r\nMAKE MORE MONEY\r\n- Spend more time selling and less time messaging and coordinating\r\n- Set your asking price for your products and earn money selling clothes, sneakers, handbags, and more\r\n- Sell safely on StockX and get paid seamlessly on StockX.\r\n\r\nDiscover your favorites and start shopping with confidence on StockX. Uncover your favorite brands, set your own prices, and make more money - all in one place. Buying and selling the world\u2019s top brands has never been easier. Download StockX now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Buy and sell on the ultimate marketplace for the world\u2019s most sought after sneakers, apparel, collectibles, and more with StockX. Stock up on the latest kicks and trends with exclusive brands and products. Buy the latest and greatest from the hottest clothing and sneaker collections to trendy handbags and the latest electronics \u2013 it\u2019s all on StockX.<br><br>Shop clothing and footwear from Nike, Air Jordan, adidas, Ugg, Vans, Asics, New Balance, and more with the latest releases just a tap away. Buy apparel, shoes, and accessories confidently with StockX\u2019s verification process. Our team of verification experts inspect and verify every product sold on our app so you can shop worry-free.<br><br>StockX is an elevated sneakers and clothing app marketplace putting you in control of the value of almost every item on our marketplace. Looking to buy? Simply place a bid with your offer and set the price you want to pay. Looking to sell? Sellers can also set asks on the products they list with sales information available on every product page. With Live Market Pricing, anyone can view real time StockX market data to find the best deals or set the best price.<br><br>Buying and selling products for the world\u2019s top brands has never been easier with StockX \u2013 from top sneakers to designer clothing and everyday essentials. Discover the best of footwear, clothing, and collectibles apps on the digital marketplace trusted by millions and featured in: ESPN, The New York Times, WSJ, Forbes, TechCrunch, Yahoo Finance, CNN, GQ, BBC, The Daily Show, Hypebeast, Bleacher Report...and many more.<br><br>Download StockX today to buy and sell exclusive sneakers, apparel, accessories, and much more.<br><br>HOW IT WORKS:<br>StockX is a resale marketplace that functions like a stock market, where Buyers place Bids and Sellers place Asks. When a Bid and Ask meet on a price, the order goes through automatically and instantaneously.<br><br>StockX Features<br><br>BUY &amp; SELL - MADE SAFE &amp; EASY<br>- Sell your brand-name items and set your own asks <br>- Sellers send every item sold to StockX for verification<br>- Our global experts inspect products, ensuring each item is genuine<br>- Buy the hottest items in sneakers, apparel and more<br>- Buyers can shop confidently and sellers never need to worry about chargebacks<br><br>DISCOVER YOUR FAVORITES<br>- Find clothes, sneakers, electronics, and accessories all in the palm of your hand<br>- Explore a variety of brands to shop from \u2013 Supreme, BAPE, Fear of God, and more<br>- Find deadstock condition sneakers including Yeezy, Jordans, Nike, adidas and New Balance<br>- From Funko Pop collectibles to luxury products and brands like Louis Vuitton, Gucci, land more \u2013 StockX has it all<br><br>LIVE MARKET PRICING<br>- Find the best deals with real time StockX data<br>- The stock market for sneakers and clothing \u2013 Compare asks when looking for your favorite products and set your own bid<br>- Get sales information on every product and learn about what you\u2019re buying<br><br>PAY WHAT YOU WANT<br>- Determine the value of almost every item on our marketplace<br>- Make an offer and set the price for what you want to pay<br><br>MAKE MORE MONEY<br>- Spend more time selling and less time messaging and coordinating<br>- Set your asking price for your products and earn money selling clothes, sneakers, handbags, and more<br>- Sell safely on StockX and get paid seamlessly on StockX.<br><br>Discover your favorites and start shopping with confidence on StockX. Uncover your favorite brands, set your own prices, and make more money - all in one place. Buying and selling the world\u2019s top brands has never been easier. Download StockX now!",
